<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Đi thôi nào, anh Grid!</font>

182
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:02,460
<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Anh bạn cơ bắp!</font>

183
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:03,510
<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Chậc!</font>

184
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:04,970
<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Khốn kiếp!</font>

